  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;dinsats forskningssamarbete 2010-2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to researchcooperation 2010-2014 - Support to researchcooperation 2010-2014: review</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

Insatsen inneb&#xe4;r en kvalitetss&#xe4;kring &#xe5;rsbudgetarna och upphandlingsplaner 2014-2015 inom forskningssamarbetet med Makerere Universitetet. Revisionsfirmans genomg&#xe5;ng kommer att p&#xe5;visa om regelverk efterf&#xf6;ljs, och om budgetarna &#xe4;r finansiellt korrekta. Insatsen kommer &#xe4;ven resultera i rekommendationer f&#xf6;r konkreta f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar av ekonomihanteringen inom samarbetet, samt vara st&#xf6;d i beredningen av nytt forskningsavtal 2015-2020.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention is a procurement, through a UM Kampala framework agreement, with Kisaka &amp; Company to make an assessment of annual budgets and procurement plans 2014-2015 in the research cooperation program with Makerere University for quality assurance, accurancy and compliance with rules and regulations, and for recommendations leading to long term institution building.</narrative>
  </description>
